      "updated": 1785760798566,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Goal : Should I carry an umbrella? \n\n\n\n\n\n\nKnowledge Base: \n\nDark clouds\n\nHumid  \n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Goal : Should I carry an umbrella? \n\n\n\n\n\n\nKnowledge Base: \n\nDark clouds\n\nHumid  \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5wcdYRf47w8RWoyqI1oFd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -699.5752592980687,
      "y": -539.1346662493795,
      "width": 1011.1356201171875,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1284596422,
      "version": 509,
      "versionNonce": 1910183550,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785760793199,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nRule 1: IF dark clouds AND humid THEN it will likely rain\nRule 2: IF it will likely rain AND going outside THEN carry umbrella\n\n\n\nHere \"IF\" part of the statement is called as condition or Antecendent\n\nThe \"AND\" part of the statement is called as conclusion or Consequent   \n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nRule 1: IF dark clouds AND humid THEN it will likely rain\nRule 2: IF it will likely rain AND going outside THEN carry umbrella\n\n\n\nHere \"IF\" part of the statement is called as condition or Antecendent\n\nThe \"AND\" part of the statement is called as conclusion or Consequent   \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
